{"seq":2,"slug":"redis-rate-limiting","title":"Redis 限流实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed/redis-rate-limiting","wordCount":1369,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"redis-限流实现\">Redis 限流实现</h1><p>Redis 在限流领域的主导地位不是偶然的——亚毫秒的读写延迟、原生的 TTL 过期机制、Lua 脚本的服务端原子执行、以及 Cluster 模式的水平扩展能力，使其精确匹配了限流系统&quot;高频、低延迟、有状态、需要原子性&quot;的全部需求。本篇深入 Redis 实现限流的具体技术方案，从数据结构选择到 Lua 脚本编写，从单实例到 Cluster 的扩展路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Redis 之所以成为限流的事实标准存储，是因为它同时满足了限流系统的四个核心需求：亚毫秒级的读写延迟（关键路径上的决策不能慢）、Lua 脚本提供的服务端原子执行（消除竞态）、原生的 TTL 过期机制（自动清理历史状态）、以及 Cluster 模式的水平扩展能力（随业务增长而扩容）。理解 Redis 的数据结构如何精确匹配各种限流算法的状态需求，是编写高效限流脚本的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"redis-数据结构与限流算法的映射\">Redis 数据结构与限流算法的映射</h2><p>不同的限流算法天然映射到不同的 Redis 数据结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>Redis 数据结构</th>\n<th>键数/用户</th>\n<th>内存开销/用户</th>\n<th>操作复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定窗口</td>\n<td>STRING</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>~60 bytes</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口日志</td>\n<td>SORTED SET</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>~80 bytes × 请求数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口计数器</td>\n<td>STRING × 2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>~120 bytes</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td>HASH (2 fields)</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>~100 bytes</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏桶/GCRA</td>\n<td>HASH (2 fields)</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>~100 bytes</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"令牌桶的-lua-脚本实现\">令牌桶的 Lua 脚本实现</h2><p>令牌桶是生产中最常用的算法之一，其 Lua 实现展示了 Redis 限流脚本的核心模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- Token Bucket Rate Limiter&#10;-- KEYS[1]: 限流键 (如 &quot;rl:user:12345&quot;)&#10;-- ARGV[1]: 桶容量 (burst)&#10;-- ARGV[2]: 填充速率 (tokens/sec)&#10;-- ARGV[3]: 当前时间戳 (秒, 浮点)&#10;-- ARGV[4]: 请求消耗的 token 数 (权重)&#10;&#10;local key = KEYS[1]&#10;local capacity = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;local refill_rate = tonumber(ARGV[2])&#10;local now = tonumber(ARGV[3])&#10;local requested = tonumber(ARGV[4])&#10;&#10;local bucket = redis.call(&#39;HMGET&#39;, key, &#39;tokens&#39;, &#39;last_refill&#39;)&#10;local tokens = tonumber(bucket[1])&#10;local last_refill = tonumber(bucket[2])&#10;&#10;-- 首次访问: 满桶&#10;if tokens == nil then&#10;    tokens = capacity&#10;    last_refill = now&#10;end&#10;&#10;-- 计算补充的 token&#10;local elapsed = math.max(0, now - last_refill)&#10;tokens = math.min(capacity, tokens + elapsed * refill_rate)&#10;&#10;-- 判断与扣减&#10;local allowed = 0&#10;local remaining = tokens&#10;&#10;if tokens &gt;= requested then&#10;    tokens = tokens - requested&#10;    allowed = 1&#10;    remaining = tokens&#10;end&#10;&#10;-- 写回状态&#10;redis.call(&#39;HMSET&#39;, key, &#39;tokens&#39;, tokens, &#39;last_refill&#39;, now)&#10;redis.call(&#39;EXPIRE&#39;, key, math.ceil(capacity / refill_rate) * 2)&#10;&#10;-- 计算 Retry-After&#10;local retry_after = 0&#10;if allowed == 0 then&#10;    retry_after = (requested - tokens) / refill_rate&#10;end&#10;&#10;return {allowed, math.floor(remaining), math.ceil(retry_after)}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Token Bucket Rate Limiter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[1]: 限流键 (如 \"rl:user:12345\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[1]: 桶容量 (burst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[2]: 填充速率 (tokens/sec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[3]: 当前时间戳 (秒, 浮点)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[4]: 请求消耗的 token 数 (权重)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local key = KEYS[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local capacity = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local refill_rate = tonumber(ARGV[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local now = tonumber(ARGV[3])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local requested = tonumber(ARGV[4])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local bucket = redis.call('HMGET', key, 'tokens', 'last_refill')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local tokens = tonumber(bucket[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local last_refill = tonumber(bucket[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 首次访问: 满桶</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if tokens == nil then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokens = capacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    last_refill = now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 计算补充的 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local elapsed = math.max(0, now - last_refill)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokens = math.min(capacity, tokens + elapsed * refill_rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 判断与扣减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local allowed = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local remaining = tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if tokens >= requested then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokens = tokens - requested</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    allowed = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    remaining = tokens</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 写回状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('HMSET', key, 'tokens', tokens, 'last_refill', now)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('EXPIRE', key, math.ceil(capacity / refill_rate) * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 计算 Retry-After</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local retry_after = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if allowed == 0 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    retry_after = (requested - tokens) / refill_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return {allowed, math.floor(remaining), math.ceil(retry_after)}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键设计决策</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>懒惰填充</strong>：不使用后台定时器，每次请求到来时根据时间差计算应补充的 token。消除了后台进程的运维开销。</li>\n<li><strong>EXPIRE 兜底</strong>：即使用户长期不活跃，键也会自动过期清理。TTL 设为&quot;桶从空到满所需时间的 2 倍&quot;作为安全边际。</li>\n<li><strong>返回三元组</strong>：(allowed, remaining, retry_after) 提供完整的响应信息，调用方可直接映射到 HTTP 响应头。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"redis-cell-原生限流模块\">Redis Cell：原生限流模块</h2><p>Redis Cell 是一个 Redis 模块，实现了 GCRA（Generic Cell Rate Algorithm）——漏桶的一种优雅变体。它通过一条命令 <code>CL.THROTTLE</code> 完成完整的限流判决：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"CL.THROTTLE user:12345 100 30 60 1&#10;              │         │   │  │  │&#10;              键名       │   │  │  请求权重&#10;                        │   │  窗口大小(秒)&#10;                        │   窗口内最大请求数&#10;                        最大突发量\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>CL.THROTTLE user:12345 100 30 60 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              │         │   │  │  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              键名       │   │  │  请求权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        │   │  窗口大小(秒)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        │   窗口内最大请求数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        最大突发量</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>返回值</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>[0]</td>\n<td>是否被限流 (0=放行, 1=拒绝)</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[1]</td>\n<td>配额总量</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[2]</td>\n<td>剩余配额</td>\n<td>67</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[3]</td>\n<td>如被限流，需等待的秒数</td>\n<td>-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[4]</td>\n<td>距配额完全恢复的秒数</td>\n<td>42</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：单命令完成全部逻辑，无需编写和维护 Lua 脚本。<strong>劣势</strong>：需要加载第三方模块（许多托管 Redis 服务不支持自定义模块）、GCRA 语义固定无法自定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"键设计与-hash-slot-规划\">键设计与 Hash Slot 规划</h2><p>在 Redis Cluster 环境下，键的设计直接影响性能和可扩展性：</p>\n<p><strong>键命名模式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"rl:{algorithm}:{identity}:{window}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>rl:{algorithm}:{identity}:{window}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>示例：<code>rl:sw:user-12345:1719849600</code></p>\n<p><strong>Hash Tag 策略</strong>：Redis Cluster 根据键中 <code>{...}</code> 包裹的部分计算 hash slot。对于需要在同一个 Lua 脚本中访问多个键的算法（如滑动窗口计数器需要当前+前一窗口两个键），必须确保它们落在同一个 slot：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"rl:sw:{user-12345}:current&#10;rl:sw:{user-12345}:previous\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>rl:sw:{user-12345}:current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rl:sw:{user-12345}:previous</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>{user-12345}</code> 作为 hash tag 保证两个键在同一 slot，Lua 脚本可以原子地访问两者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;rl:sw:{user-123}:current&quot;] --&gt; S1[Slot 7821]&#10;    B[&quot;rl:sw:{user-123}:previous&quot;] --&gt; S1&#10;    C[&quot;rl:sw:{user-456}:current&quot;] --&gt; S2[Slot 3042]&#10;    D[&quot;rl:sw:{user-456}:previous&quot;] --&gt; S2&#10;&#10;    S1 --&gt; N1[Redis Node 1]&#10;    S2 --&gt; N2[Redis Node 2]\">graph TD\n    A[\"rl:sw:{user-123}:current\"] --&gt; S1[Slot 7821]\n    B[\"rl:sw:{user-123}:previous\"] --&gt; S1\n    C[\"rl:sw:{user-456}:current\"] --&gt; S2[Slot 3042]\n    D[\"rl:sw:{user-456}:previous\"] --&gt; S2\n\n    S1 --&gt; N1[Redis Node 1]\n    S2 --&gt; N2[Redis Node 2]</pre><p><strong>热键问题</strong>：如果某个高流量用户的限流键集中在单个 slot（进而集中在单个 Redis 节点），可能导致该节点过热。缓解策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对超高频键使用本地缓存 + 批量同步（前文混合方案）</li>\n<li>将全局限流键按时间窗口分片到不同的 hash tag</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pipeline-与批量优化\">Pipeline 与批量优化</h2><p>当网关节点需要为同一个请求检查多条限流规则时（如同时检查 per-user、per-endpoint、global 三个限流），可以使用 Redis Pipeline 将多条命令打包发送：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"PIPELINE:&#10;  EVALSHA &lt;token_bucket_sha&gt; 1 rl:tb:{user-123} 100 10 1719849600.5 1&#10;  EVALSHA &lt;sliding_window_sha&gt; 2 rl:sw:{endpoint:/api/data}:cur rl:sw:{endpoint:/api/data}:prev 1000 60 1719849600.5 1&#10;  EVALSHA &lt;token_bucket_sha&gt; 1 rl:tb:{global} 50000 833 1719849600.5 1&#10;EXEC\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>PIPELINE:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  EVALSHA &#x3C;token_bucket_sha> 1 rl:tb:{user-123} 100 10 1719849600.5 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  EVALSHA &#x3C;sliding_window_sha> 2 rl:sw:{endpoint:/api/data}:cur rl:sw:{endpoint:/api/data}:prev 1000 60 1719849600.5 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  EVALSHA &#x3C;token_bucket_sha> 1 rl:tb:{global} 50000 833 1719849600.5 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXEC</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条规则的检查在一次网络往返中完成，总延迟约等于单条命令的延迟（而非三倍）。</p>\n<p><strong>EVALSHA vs EVAL</strong>：首次执行 <code>SCRIPT LOAD</code> 将 Lua 脚本加载到 Redis 并获取 SHA1 摘要，后续使用 <code>EVALSHA</code> 仅传递摘要而非完整脚本文本。节省带宽且避免重复编译。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存容量规划\">内存容量规划</h2><p>限流系统的内存需求取决于&quot;活跃限流键数量 × 每键开销&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景参数</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>活跃用户数</td>\n<td>1,000,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每用户限流维度</td>\n<td>3 (user + endpoint × 2)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每键内存</td>\n<td>~120 bytes (HASH + metadata)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总内存需求</td>\n<td>1M × 3 × 120B = <strong>360 MB</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>加上 Redis 本身的内存开销（fragmentation ratio 约 1.2x），一个 512MB 的 Redis 实例足以支撑百万用户级的限流。这远低于大多数 Redis 部署的规模。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Redis + Lua 脚本是分布式限流的标准技术栈，提供原子性保证与亚毫秒延迟</li>\n<li>令牌桶的懒惰填充模式消除了后台进程需求，单个 HASH 键即可持久化完整状态</li>\n<li>Redis Cell 模块提供开箱即用的 GCRA 限流，但受限于托管服务的模块支持</li>\n<li>Cluster 环境下必须通过 Hash Tag 确保多键 Lua 脚本的原子性</li>\n<li>Pipeline 批量执行使多维限流检查的延迟不随规则数线性增长</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"multi-cluster-sync\">多集群同步</a> 讨论跨数据中心的限流状态同步</li>\n<li>Envoy 代理如何利用 Redis 实现全局限流：<a href=\"../../service-mesh/implementations/envoy-proxy-deep-dive\">Envoy 代理深入</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Redis 限流实现","id":"redis-限流实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Redis 数据结构与限流算法的映射","id":"redis-数据结构与限流算法的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌桶的 Lua 脚本实现","id":"令牌桶的-lua-脚本实现"},{"level":2,"text":"Redis Cell：原生限流模块","id":"redis-cell-原生限流模块"},{"level":2,"text":"键设计与 Hash Slot 规划","id":"键设计与-hash-slot-规划"},{"level":2,"text":"Pipeline 与批量优化","id":"pipeline-与批量优化"},{"level":2,"text":"内存容量规划","id":"内存容量规划"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式计数与一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed/distributed-counting"},"next":{"title":"多集群同步与跨数据中心限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed/multi-cluster-sync"}}